# Stable spec ID: iba-negroni. Source checked 2026-10-12. Machine generated; not human reviewed.

::ingredients
(gin) 30 ml
(bitter aperitif @ Campari) 30 ml
(vermouth; sweet red) 30 ml

::equipment
(old-fashioned glass)

::instructions
{drink} = (gin) + (bitter aperitif @ Campari) + (vermouth; sweet red)
{drink} <combine, over ice in a chilled (old-fashioned glass)> <stir, gently>
<garnish, with half an orange slice>

